---
// WhoFor.astro — "Who this is for" section (plan §3, verbatim copy)
---

<section class="whofor" aria-labelledby="whofor-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="whofor-inner">

      <p class="stag reveal d1">Who this is for</p>

      <h2 class="heading reveal d2" id="whofor-heading">
        Married couples. Big families.
        <em>Families who want to be big.</em>
        People who think children are
        <span class="underline-accent">a blessing,</span>
        not a carbon footprint.
      </h2>

      <p class="sub reveal d3">
        If that's you, you've been poorly served by consumer software for a long
        time. Apps built for DINKs, optimized for attention, designed around the
        assumption that a family is a liability. We think the opposite, and we
        build accordingly.
      </p>

      <ul class="checklist reveal d4" role="list">
        <li class="check-item">
          <span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Designed for households with three, four, five kids, not just one</span>
        </li>
        <li class="check-item">
          <span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Built around marriage as the organizing unit</span>
        </li>
        <li class="check-item">
          <span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Shipped by people who have kids and use the apps themselves</span>
        </li>
        <li class="check-item">
          <span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Made by people who take the fertility crisis seriously</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .whofor {
    padding: 88px 0;
    background: var(--bg-tinted);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .whofor-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  /* Eyebrow stag */
  .stag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }

  /* h2 */
  .heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .heading em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* "a blessing," underline accent */
  .underline-accent {
    display: inline;
    background-image: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      var(--accent) 0%,
      var(--accent) 100%
    );
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: 0 100%;
    background-size: 100% 2px;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }

  /* Sub paragraph */
  .sub {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  /* Checklist */
  .checklist {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .check-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .check-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  /* Responsive — 980px */
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .whofor {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }
    .whofor-inner {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  /* Responsive — 640px */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .whofor {
      padding: 56px 0;
    }
    .heading {
      font-size: clamp(22px, 6vw, 32px);
    }
    .sub {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .check-item {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }

  /* Reduced motion */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .whofor * {
      transition: none !important;
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
